[node name="OverheadHoist" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "FIXED OVERHEAD HOIST (OverheadHoist). Carriage runs along this node's X axis (rail_length). One crew member takes the Pendant controls [E]: A/D run, W raise, S lower.
Anyone hooks a load: [E] on the Hook (or on a LiftingEye) when the hook is next to it. Unhook only once the load rests on something.
The chain is a one-sided spring: braking is harder than accelerating, so stops swing the load."
script = ExtResource("1_overhe")

